2188 0 obj
  << /ActualText (10\056 REWARD STRUCTURE\n\nAll rewards are optional\056 Players who explore gain advantages \024 better weapons\054 tactical information \024 but players who push straight through still complete the level\056 Stealth players find suppressors\056 Combat players find rifles\056 Every reward reinforces the playstyle the player has already chosen rather than pushing them toward a new one\056)
     /K [ 84 ]
     /P 2189 0 R
     /Pg 2020 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
